Port 993
User amunozgo@purdue.edu
PassCmd "oama access amunozgo@purdue.edu"
TLSType IMAPS
CertificateFile /etc/ssl/certs/ca-certificates.crt
AuthMechs XOAUTH2

IMAPStore purdue-remote
Account purdue

MaildirStore purdue-local
SubFolders Verbatim
Path ~/.mail/purdue/
Inbox ~/.mail/purdue/Inbox

Channel purdue
Far :purdue-remote:
Near :purdue-local:
Patterns * !Calendar !Calendar/* !Contacts !Journal !Notes !Outbox !Tasks
Create Both
Expunge Both
SyncState *
